Date: Mon, 3 Aug 2026 16:58:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] chore: remove dead code and scratch files

49 unreachable modules, established by walking imports from app/ routes
(43 unused shadcn components plus QuickCompleteButton, theme-provider,
the hooks/ barrel, and duplicate use-toast/use-mobile copies). Only
alert, button, card, input, label and tabs are actually reachable.

Keeps lib/supabase/types.ts: unimported, but it is the generated snapshot
of the live schema and the only machine-readable record of it.

Also drops find-unused-files.js, three updat*.md scratch notes, and
styles/globals.css (a duplicate of app/globals.css; only the latter is
imported).
