From: cxristalclear <cldanielle19@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 3 Aug 2026 17:00:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] fix(types): enable typechecking and linting in builds

next.config.mjs had ignoreBuildErrors and ignoreDuringBuilds set to true,
which is why none of this was visible. Now clean, via three fixes:

- PomodoroContextType declared toggleNotifications,
  requestNotificationPermission, areNotificationsEnabled and
  sendNotification. 083c4c3 removed the notifications feature but left
  these behind; usePomodoroLogic never implemented them.
- updateSettings is typed Promise<void> but returns the updated Settings.
- The settings page read Notification.permission during render.
  Notification is undefined during SSR and on iOS Safari outside an
  installed PWA, so that section could crash the page. Now read into
  state in an effect and the section is hidden where unsupported.
